{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_73","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"planSummary\":\"Revised Story 1 to close SV-01 and SV-02 by adding project-shell and process-surface attach actions, wiring them to the existing POST source-attachment routes through the client bootstrap/browser API layer, refreshing the active surface immediately after create, and extending process currentSources to carry and render repositoryFullName and attachmentScope.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/process-work-surface.ts\",\"reason\":\"Extended process current-source contracts to carry repositoryFullName and attachmentScope.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\",\"reason\":\"Projected repositoryFullName and attachmentScope into process currentSources.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/projects/source-attachment-composer.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added the reusable client attach form used by both project and process surfaces.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/projects/source-attachment-section.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added the project-surface attach action UI alongside the source attachment section.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/projects/project-shell-page.ts\",\"reason\":\"Wired the project shell to render and submit the attach action.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/processes/process-materials-section.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added the process-surface attach action UI and rendered repository identity/scope for current sources.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/processes/process-work-surface-page.ts\",\"reason\":\"Wired the process work surface to submit process-scoped attaches.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/app/shell-app.ts\",\"reason\":\"Threaded attach callbacks through the shell renderer into project and process surfaces.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"reason\":\"Implemented attach handlers that call the existing POST APIs and immediately refetch/refresh the active project or process surface after create.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/browser-api/projects-api.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added the project-scoped source-attachment client API wrapper.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/browser-api/process-work-surface-api.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added the process-scoped source-attachment client API wrapper.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/fixtures/materials.ts\",\"reason\":\"Extended process current-source fixtures with repositoryFullName and attachmentScope.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/project-shell-page.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Covered the project-shell attach action path.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/process-materials-section.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Covered process-surface repository identity and scope rendering.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Covered process attach action wiring and process-surface identity/scope visibility.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/create-process-modal.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Adjusted modal assertions to account for the newly added source-attach inputs on the shell.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/source-management-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Strengthened process attach assertions to require repositoryFullName and attachmentScope in refreshed currentSources.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated process work-surface expectations for the expanded currentSources contract.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"tests/service/client/project-shell-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/process-materials-section.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/create-process-modal.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/source-management-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":598,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":3},\"